4,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I'm looking forward to learning about the park. I think it would be helpful to know about the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,It's a pleasure to meet you all! Let's make this interesting. I'm curious about the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services. I want to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I believe it would be wise to look at the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that we need a clear picture of the operational side. I would like to look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we're all eager to dive in. To ensure we don't pick a fantasy that fails in reality, I'll look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,It is interesting to see what everyone is curious about. I think we are covering a lot of different areas. I will stick with my choices for now.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're so cautious! I'm just making sure we don't get blinded by a pretty picture. I'll stick with my choices too; the numbers usually tell the real story.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see such enthusiasm. I believe that by looking at the past, we can better protect our future. I shall keep my choices as they are.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I believe we have a balanced approach. I am particularly interested in how the human element—both paid and unpaid—will sustain the park over time. I will maintain my selections.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Balance is a generous word for it. We have plenty of curiosity, but let's see if it translates into actual insight. I'll stick with my choices; the ground doesn't lie, even if the plans do.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the information we find helps us make a choice that makes everyone happy. I'm still very curious to see what the notes say about the site. I will keep my choices.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, ""everyone happy"" is a tall order, isn't it? I'm more interested in a plan that doesn't bankrupt us in three years. I'm staying with my picks. Let's see what the data reveals!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, it is true that happiness is a tall order, but perhaps we can find a middle ground together. I am quite content with my choices. I look forward to hearing what you all discover.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I believe a middle ground is possible if we prioritize sustainability. I am curious to see if the current staffing levels can actually support a new development. I will keep my choices.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Sustainability is a lovely buzzword, Victoria, but it's usually just a mask for ""hope for the best."" I'll stick with my data. Let's move this along and see what we actually find.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I agree with Shunichi that we should move forward. I hope we can all be kind to each other as we share what we've learned. I'll keep my choices as they are.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"Kindness is sweet, Minato, but I'll take a balanced budget over a smile any day! I'm all set with my choices. Let's get to the juicy details and see who's actually being realistic.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@May, a smile and a balanced budget can certainly go hand in hand. I believe we are all coming from a place of care for our city. I am ready to see the results.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. While we have different priorities, our shared goal is the park's success. I am ready to review the findings and see how they impact the long-term viability of the plans.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's hope the ""care for our city"" translates into a plan that actually works when it rains. I'm ready. Let's see if the reality of the site matches the ambition of the proposals.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
